      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spectacularly situated 4 bed coastal property with lofted garage offering panoramic harbour views. Featuring a tarmac drive, manicured lawns, private entertainment area, large sun room and an immaculate interior. Discreetly located just off Union Hall's main street within a short walk of all amenities.\r\nServices: Oil fired cental heating, mains services, broadband"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Porch - 2.5m x 1.0m \r\nWooden floor, french doors\r\n\r\nSun Room - 7.0m x 3.5m \r\nWooden floor, french doors to patio, raised panel ceiling, panoramic harbour views\r\n\r\nInner Hall - 6.5m x 2.0m \r\nWooden floor, glass door to sun room, staircase\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 7.0m x 5.0m \r\nWooden floor, solid fuel stove with marble surround, built in display cabinet, glass doors to south facing patio\r\n\r\nDining Room/Lounge - 5.2m x 4.6m \r\nMarble fireplace, sliding glass doors to deck\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.6m x 3.6m \r\nModern kitchen, Stanley oil cooker, gas hob, electric double oven, washing machine, built in seating\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.8m x 2.3m \r\nWooden floor, kitchen units, sink unit, fridge freezer, dishwasher, dryer\r\n\r\nWashroom - 2.3m x 1.0m \r\nVanity unit, w.c.\r\n\r\nLanding - 5.2m x 1.3m \r\nHotpress\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 5.2m x 4.2m \r\nBuilt in wardrobe, dressing table\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 3.0m x 1.6m \r\nShower unit, vanity unit, w.c. closet\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.5m x 3.0m \r\nBuilt in storage\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.5m x 1.0m \r\nShower unit, wash hand basin, w.c\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 5.0m x 3.0m \r\nBuilt in storage\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 5.0m x 3.0m \r\nBuilt in storage\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.0m x 2.0m \r\nBath, wash hand basin, w.c. storage\r\n\r\nGarage - 7.6m x 4.8m \r\n\r\n\r\nEntertainment Area - 5.2m x 3.0m \r\nCovered area, open area, large barbeque\r\n\r\n"
      },
